1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,469
Spring became summer.

2
00:00:01,469 --> 00:00:12,860
In May 2023, a pre-debut song called Dream hit number one on Billboard's Hot Trending Songs chart — a song nobody could buy, performed by girls nobody could see yet.

3
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:20,695
The YouTube channel crossed a million subscribers in fifty-two days, the fastest any K-pop girl group had ever done it.

4
00:00:20,695 --> 00:00:23,157
And the debut date kept not arriving.

